  "title": "h5i",
  "excerpt": "**h5i** (pronounced *high-five*) is an Axum-based Rust web framework built around application kernels that can be formally verified with Lean 4 and executed on servers, bare-metal embedded devices, and GPUs. It also provides integrated development infrastructure for red-teaming, security regression testing, and sandboxed AI agents."
